BrewDeck public assets

The code of BrewDeck is licensed under the MIT license, see LICENSE at the
root of the repository. The files of this directory belong to their owners
and are used under the terms listed below.

appearance/
    Boot logos (bootlogo/), Nyx backgrounds (background/) and boot menu icons
    (icon/) for hekate and Nyx, redistributed under the GPL-2.0 license of the
    projects they come from. Boot logos were converted from the rotated bitmaps
    hekate expects to the orientation they are seen on screen, icons from the
    bitmaps of Nyx to PNG with their transparency.

    */hekate-*.png           CTCaer, GPL-2.0
                             https://github.com/CTCaer/hekate
    */atmosphere-*.png       Atmosphère-NX, GPL-2.0
                             https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere
    icon/mattera-*.png       Nichole Mattera, GPL-2.0, as stated for every icon
                             in its folder of the repository: the Atmosphère
                             one uses the logo by jaames for Atmosphère-NX, the
                             Switch and payload ones are redrawn after the Nyx
                             icons of CTCaer
                             https://github.com/NicholeMattera/Hekate-Icons

images/
    Product photos of the Nintendo Switch consoles from the Nintendo online
    store (nintendo.com). Nintendo Switch, its logos and the photos are
    trademarks and copyrighted works of Nintendo. They only illustrate the
    console revisions, BrewDeck is not affiliated with Nintendo.

